    "# ️ Glu-Stock: 03_EXECUTION_MONITOR\n",
    "**Phase**: Command & Control | v18.26.9 (Dynamic Recap)\n",
    "\n",
    "This notebook reports trade plans generated dynamically by the LLM Brain."
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "metadata": {},
